&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:9pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingAmountOfContractLiabilitiesTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingWriteDownsOfInventoriesTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:22.5pt;text-indent:-18pt;"&gt;※１　期末棚卸高は収益性の低下による簿価切下後の金額であり、次の棚卸資産評価損及び棚卸資産評価戻入益が売上原価に含まれております。　&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_unitR" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="tbld" style="margin-left:30pt;margin-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:solid 0pt #000000;width:451.8pt;table-layout:fixed;"&gt;
&lt;colgroup&gt;
&lt;col style="width:128.9pt;min-width:128.9pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:97pt;min-width:97pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:128.9pt;min-width:128.9pt;"/&gt;
&lt;col style="width:97pt;min-width:97pt;"/&gt;
